---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import {
	Code2,
	Braces,
	Database,
	Globe,
	Palette,
	Terminal,
} from "@lucide/astro";
---

<Layout>
    <section id="header" class="md:h-[50vh] flex flex-col justify-end pl-4 pr-4 md:pr-0 pt-4 mb-5 md:mb-10">
        <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-5">
			About Me
		</h1>
        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Software Developer & College Student. I work mostly with Javascript (NextJS, Astro) and Python (Flask, Django) based frameworks.</h2>
    </section>
    <section id="body" class="pl-4 pr-4 md:pr-0 mb-5">
        <p class="text-md mb-2">I'm Emmanuel A, a college student and software developer based for now in Rwanda, and I'm currently focusing on full-stack web development. I'm familiar with Javascript (NextJS, Astro, Remix, etc) and Python (Flask, Django) based frameworks for web development. I can also build cross-platform mobile apps with React Native and other things like Discord bots, Chrome extensions, and Tampermonkey scripts. I also have a sound background in Cybersecurity.</p>
        <p class="text-md mb-2">When I'm not coding, I'm most likely playing games (Mostly FPS and ARPG games). I'm into all things speed and I especially like JDM sports cars and superbikes. I also do instagram edits in my free time, so you could say my video editing skills are at least average.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience -->
    <section id="experience" class="pl-4 pr-4 md:pr-0 mb-5">
        <h3 class="text-lg mb-4">Experience & Credentials</h3>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-md">
            <p>
                <span class="block">BSc Computer Science</span>
                <span class="muted">University of the People, 2023 - Present</span>
            </p>
            <p>
                <span class="block">MCIT Cybersecurity Certificate</span>
                <span class="muted">IBM Skills Build, 2026</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

        <!-- Skills -->
    <section id="skills" class="pl-4 pr-4 md:pr-0 pb-5">
        <h3 class="text-lg mb-4">Skills</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 max-w-3xl">
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                JavaScript / TypeScript
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                Next.js
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                Astro
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                Remix
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                React Native
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                Python
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                Flask
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                Django
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                REST APIs
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-2 border theme-border text-sm">
                Cybersecurity
            </span>
        </div>
    </section>

    
    
</Layout>
